"collision": ["Collision shape built from the model, unless the model brings its own. default uses the project setting trenchdot/collision/model_shape, convex unless changed. box is one box around the model, convex decomposition several hulls that follow concave models, trimesh follows every face", "default"],
"collision_layer": "Physics layers the body is on, as layer numbers such as 1, 3. Empty keeps the project default, none puts it on no layer",
